At one gram per worm, Simba is gonna need to find, and consume, about 3,000

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:37.020
Mopane worms EVERY DAY to get his daily nutritional requirements.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:40.560
And while the eggs and larva of these caterpillars are found in small groups are found in small groups,

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.940
fully grown ones are less likely to be clustered  as they seperate out to

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.520
seek space to pupate and become moths.

